sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client or app
    participant Auth as auth (:8084)
    participant CAPI as client-api (:8080)

    Client->>Auth: POST /auth/token (client_id and client_secret)
    Auth-->>Client: access token (JWT, default TTL 60 s) and refresh token
    Client->>CAPI: GET /api/v1/hazards (Authorization: Bearer JWT)
    Note over CAPI: Verifies signature and checks scopes locally (shared secret)
    CAPI-->>Client: response
    Note over Auth: Refresh rotation and revocation are process-local
    Note over CAPI: Issued JWTs remain valid until expiration despite refresh revocation
